    <string name="help_q_1">Why is it necessary to log in to download files?</string>
    <string name="help_r_1">To download stories and posts from private accounts, you need to log in. However, downloading public posts does not require a login.</string>

    <string name="help_q_2">Does logging into Instagram present any privacy or security risks?</string>
    <string name="help_r_2">The login process is handled directly through Instagram\'s official website. We are not connected with Instagram and do not gather your personal information. We follow all relevant privacy regulations.</string>


    <string name="help_q_3">How can you resolve the "Incorrect Password" error when logging in?</string>
    <string name="help_r_3">"1- Verify whether your password contains any extra characters, such as spaces.\n2- Attempt to log in to the Instagram app.\n3- If the issue continues, try uninstalling and then reinstalling the app.\n4- If it still doesn't work, please verify that your Instagram account and password are correct, and contact support at: <a href="mailto:smartbits.apps@gmail.com">Support Email</a>"</string>


    <string name="help_q_4">How do I cancel a subscription?</string>
    <string name="help_r_4">To manage your subscription, go to the "Subscriptions" section in the Google Play Store.</string>

    <string name="help_q_5">I Still can\'t download private post after login</string>
    <string name="help_r_5">If you\'re already logged into your Instagram account and trying to download private posts, make sure that the account you\'re using follows the post owner. Also, double-check that you\'ve selected the correct profile from the profiles page.</string>
